From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebberich <sebberich@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:34:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 28/29] Mobile: Shopping list quantities, member names and
 change notifications
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Typed names are kept as typed; the catalog only supplies emoji and
  category.
- Quantities add up ("3 Eier" + "Eier 7" = 10, "-4 Eier" subtracts,
  never below 0) as a per-device counter that merges without losing
  concurrent additions; reaching 0 marks the item bought; re-opening
  within 5 minutes restores the old quantity, later starts fresh. Notes
  such as "Bio" are kept separately.
- Each device publishes an encrypted profile event with its name, so
  renaming in the settings reaches all members; the default name is the
  device model.
- Share screen: fixed header, crisp QR code with quiet zone, "Share…"
  opens the system share sheet with an invite message.
- Notifications when others change a list (aggregated per list, global
  and per-list switch) and a foreground service that keeps Bluetooth
  sync alive with the screen off.

